  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvcr0vhd0hqbwpojv1huuxnzg?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvcr0vhd0hqbwpojv1huuxnzg/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33344573661&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=rxWb5QOJq4fojqV%2FIUmr3aAiL5g%3D&amp;ts=1787664861\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvcr0vhd0hqbwpojv1huuxnzg?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Y3IwdmhkMGhxYndwb2p2MWh1dXhuemciLCJ0aWQiOiJjZmIyMWMyYy02YjgyLTQwMzYtYWI0Yy0wNjM4YmJjYjJhODUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNTl9.zZ2vAFrQx-OxN99ng74X3VzAh0JRNK8VvS9EqnjGIpzELCJv_h_g_uA5CPeDAPTm6UAhnZM-8aJ4WFtMA9kjmw&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Y3IwdmhkMGhxYndwb2p2MWh1dXhuemciLCJ0aWQiOiJjZmIyMWMyYy02YjgyLTQwMzYtYWI0Yy0wNjM4YmJjYjJhODUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNTl9.zZ2vAFrQx-OxN99ng74X3VzAh0JRNK8VvS9EqnjGIpzELCJv_h_g_uA5CPeDAPTm6UAhnZM-8aJ4WFtMA9kjmw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">마찰전기</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">질문있니? &gt; 교실은 한 순간에 조용해집니다 <br>어떻게 하면 질문으로 학생들을 수업에 초대할 수 있을까<br>유튜브에서 학생들이 좋아할만한 신기해할만한 실험을 한참 찾습니다. 학생들이 직접 경험하게 하고, 질문 유발 영상 자료를 준비합니다. <br><br>아이들은 눈앞의 선생님이 무언가를 보여주는 것을 좋아하는 것 같습니다. </p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvitfzrbg0z8f3rvuegk89pmi?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"720\" data-video-height=\"1280\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvitfzrbg0z8f3rvuegk89pmi/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33344573683&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=PhEZhrLiSzc9oiFAenKREnWziLQ%3D&amp;ts=1787664883\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"720\" data-video-origin-height=\"1280\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvitfzrbg0z8f3rvuegk89pmi?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aXRmenJiZzB6OGYzcnZ1ZWdrODlwbWkiLCJ0aWQiOiI3OWJmMTYyNC1jMDU1LTRjMGEtYjBlOC1lZmI3YmRiY2M0MWMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNTl9.GhkKyYxeFLivfFq3HgiXDQrVFPR8spipr-Z_wGK7CQ0LIGUCMKO80qkwr1LDJK3Rv4luaGiuCbQxG7INd8RrWw&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aXRmenJiZzB6OGYzcnZ1ZWdrODlwbWkiLCJ0aWQiOiI3OWJmMTYyNC1jMDU1LTRjMGEtYjBlOC1lZmI3YmRiY2M0MWMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNTl9.GhkKyYxeFLivfFq3HgiXDQrVFPR8spipr-Z_wGK7CQ0LIGUCMKO80qkwr1LDJK3Rv4luaGiuCbQxG7INd8RrWw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">정전기유도</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이렇게 영상을 준비하는 경우에도 교실에서도 실제로 꼭 보여줍니다. <br><br>학생들은 질문과수원에 로그인하여 자신의 질문을 남깁니다. 친구의 질문이 궁금하면 물주기를 통해 친구와 나의 나무를 자라게 할 수 있습니다(도배방지해뒀습니다)<br><br>질문이 올라오고나면 다같이 질문을 읽어봅니다. 이 시간이 학생들 눈이 가장 초롱초롱합니다. 학생들의 질문이 수업의 주제가 됩니다. 많이 벗어나면 어쩌지? 했지만 괜한 걱정이었습니다 </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95b646c9125418e72dc5c36228573cb1b2a10cef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95b646c9125418e72dc5c36228573cb1b2a10cef\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1235\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06153ebf2a8b16991bf67e955885a1a13a23e3de\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06153ebf2a8b16991bf67e955885a1a13a23e3de\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1481\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db22e91abdc95c78d5f0a1ecfd43b9cec9bfd678\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db22e91abdc95c78d5f0a1ecfd43b9cec9bfd678\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3d9edc679aff07e1e11d2c1ae23262bb2c3f401\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3d9edc679aff07e1e11d2c1ae23262bb2c3f401\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1510\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a2a43f1a9c447018e7fe4ae3a565803bf039973\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a2a43f1a9c447018e7fe4ae3a565803bf039973\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1380\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">수업에 활기를 준 질문, 날카로운 질문 등 그 자리에서 바로 제가 별표 도장을 찍습니다. 그러면 온라인으로 연결된 학생 도장판에 도장이 바로 부여됩니다. 귀여운 탐구생물이 알을 까고 나옵니다.  중2학생들이 이런 걸 좋아할 줄 몰랐습니다.  저도 수업이 너무나 즐겁습니다. 예상치못한 질문이 너무 반갑고, 질문이 모여 학습목표가 되는 경험이 짜릿합니다. <br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fc0d5dfba7